Hello,

I am using HAL2 and wrote the basic code below:

```

while (1) {

HAL_GPIO_TogglePin(LD1_PORT, LD1_PIN);

HAL_Delay(1);

}

```

I looked at the pin with an oscilloscope and I see that the signal stays 2ms low and 2ms high. If I change the code to HAL\_Delay(0) I get a signal that stays low 1ms and high 1ms. It's as if the delay is actually the HAL\_Delay parameter plus 1ms.

Any explanation?

-Gil
